                                "sense_id": "a47e9212-5eb1-34dc-adff-9866d65b2e25",
                                "text": "He drank a copious amount of vodka, and passed out."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "98d82bdc-866e-41f6-a0d2-bf254183ef2f",
                                "sense_id": "a47e9212-5eb1-34dc-adff-9866d65b2e25",
                                "text": "These loose hints I have thrown together, in order to excite the curiosity of philosophers, and beget a suspicion at least, if not a full persuasion, that this subject is very copious,"
